                                "sense_id": "feb32774-bc33-335d-822a-058d82ea3753",
                                "text": "[Never heard of] the Imperial Kingdom of Calsahara? The Conch Republic? The Principality of Sealand? You’re not alone. Léo Delafontaine hadn’t either until 2012, when he visited the Republic of Saugeais, a self-proclaimed micronation in eastern France. He's since become fascinated with \"countries\" unrecognized by world governments and organizations."
